# Lane 6 Regression Specification: macOS GUI, 2D Graphics, and Web Engine Fixes
#
# Verifies root-cause bug fixes across:
# 1. 2D Color & Scene Graph Rasterizer (typed palette builders, abs, CSS color numeric guard, nested clip_push intersection)
# 2. Blink HTML5 Tokenizer, CSS Selector Parser, Style/Paint Effects, and WHATWG URL UTF-8 Decoder
# 3. Browser CORS Safelist Byte Scanning, Public Suffix IDN Binary Search & Domain Validation
# 4. HTTP/1.1 Octet-Exact Chunked Framing, Async HTTP Proxy Dechunking, HPACK UTF-8, HTML Entities
# 5. GUI / TUI / WM Theme CSS / UI Identity / RichText Unicode Preservation

